  "question": {
    "text": "A pole stands vertically in the center of a square. When <math><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> is the elevation of the sun,&nbsp; the tip of its shadow just reaches the side of the square and is at a distance of&nbsp;<math><mn>30</mn></math> meters and <math><mn>40</mn></math> meters from the ends of that side.&nbsp;The height of the pole is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>50</mn></math> meters",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>25</mn></math> meters",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> meters",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>50</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> meters",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0008_bd302f775ed7.png\" style=\"width:2.92014in;height:1.68681in\" /><br />Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> is a square and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> is the pole.<br />Now, <math><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />Also,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math> meters<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math> meters<br />Side of square <math><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></math> meters<br />Now in <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math>,</p><p><math><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi></math> (let)<br />Now, let a&nbsp;perpendicular is drawn from <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> to <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> which is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math><br />In <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math>,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>70</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> meters<br /><math><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>70</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></math> meters<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> meters</p>"
  }
